s\n\n- 4.4.beta\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11 (build 22621) - Vulkan (Forward+)\n\n### Issue description\n\nJolt Physics gives an error when I use a `ConcavePolygonShape3D` generated from a mesh as the collision shape for an `Area3D`.\n\n```cmd\nERROR: modules\\jolt_physics\\jolt_globals.cpp:79 - Jolt Physics assertion 'inMassProperties.mMass > 0.0f' failed with message 'Invalid mass.\nSome shapes like MeshShape or TriangleShape cannot calculate mass automatically, in this case you need to provide it by setting BodyCreationSettings::mOverrideMassProperties and mMassPropertiesOverride.' at 'thirdparty\\jolt_physics\\Jolt\\Physics\\Body\\MotionProperties.cpp:31'\n```\n\nThe error doesn't make much sense since mass is not relevant for `Area3D` and it doesn't happen when using the shape with static or rigidbody nodes.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Open \"boulder.tscn\" in the MRP.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[jolt-error.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18507550/jolt-error.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.git